This folder holds untouched downloads from the original real data sources:
- apache_jira_raw.csv (from 01_extract_apache_jira.py)
- pcaob_deficiencies_raw.csv (manually downloaded from pcaobus.org)
- sec_edgar_disclosures_raw.json (from 02_extract_pcaob_sec_edgar.py)

Files are not committed here until you run the extraction scripts.
